<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A0.SS1" title="In Towards Reliable and Practical LLM Security Evaluations via Bayesian Modelling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">-A</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Supplementary results for the independence assumption investigations in Section <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></span></a></li>
