<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">TABLE VI: </span>Prompts belonging to each cluster approximately according to the PSM matrix for the <em id="A0.T6.4" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Latent injection (En Fr)</em> attack, presented in the same order as Figures <a href="#A0.F6" title="Fig. 6 ‣ -C Supplementary results for the model validation in Section ‣ Towards Reliable and Practical LLM Security Evaluations via Bayesian Modelling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> and <a href="#A0.F7" title="Fig. 7 ‣ -C Supplementary results for the model validation in Section ‣ Towards Reliable and Practical LLM Security Evaluations via Bayesian Modelling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>. Since the clusters are very similar for both the 2.8b Mamba and Transformer models, we simply present the clusters for the 2.8b Mamba model.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
